wo_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 75, "last_played": 1571605841, "avatar": "6f050540ffc2732ecf3e0e284310e5f18b461dfc"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game id fun if you like to be on the verge of being over run and nearly dieing while blasting aliens to bits", "timestamp_created": 1569168513, "timestamp_updated": 1569168513, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.489572972059249878", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55177823", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968102183", "personaname": "ciarinkelfie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ciarinkelfie/", "num_games_owned": 171, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 62429, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 57871, "last_played": 1592858635, "avatar": "5fea668694c95ff82c2d9cc2b2afdb06a9d2bbb4"}, "language": "english", "review": "amazing co op game. it can get really tough so its good to rely on your teamates and stick together. different classes to choose from and a wide selection of gun and epuipment. overall i would rate this game a 7/10 it could have used more campaigns and more tasks to complete such as the computer hacking. it would have been nice to see character customization but for being a free game i guess we got all we could ask for. definitely worth having though.", "timestamp_created": 1568859974, "timestamp_updated": 1568859974, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "55138085", "author": {"steamid": "76561197997460729", "personaname": "Man of Mines", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/MogTrotter/", "num_games_owned": 216, "num_reviews": 51, "playtime_forever": 2277, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2277, "last_played": 1417599623, "avatar": "824f1499c36cfe40881853bed0664560cf5f5c30"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'm surprised I never made a review for this game in the past. \n\nIn the past, the main purpose for me getting this game was to get a TF2 alien-swarm hat (that I no longer have, because stupid me traded it when achievement items were still tradable); but over time, I truly learned to love this game. I played it quite a-lot when this game was in its glory, and remember very vividly what I used to do (buying traps, killing the aliens with flamethrowers, etc), and how fun the game was. I can't remember whether this game was free back then, but I'm pretty sure it was, so that was an added bonus. \n\nTo my knowledge, this game hasn't changed much since back in its glory-years, but if that's true, I'd still recommend it, because I certainly would've back then. It's sad seeing this old gem in an abandoned state, and I still get oddly nostalgic looking back on my moments playing the game. It isn't a game I'd play anymore, but I'd still recommend it to anyone who thinks the game would fit them, and the people that have friends for co-op, otherwise then it'd be hard finding online servers, to my knowledge. \n\nFrom what I remember, an 8.5/10 would be suitable for this game, possibly due to my nostalgic bias on this game, but it's the fairest take I can make on it.", "timestamp_created": 1568630216, "timestamp_updated": 1568630216, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 19, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.71580803394317627", "comment_count": 4, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {